E COMPLEX FOR INTENSE POWER AND STRENGTH*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NATURAL & ARTIFICIAL FLAVOR"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NET WT"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"NOTICE: Significant product settling may occur."},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Pre-Workout Hybrid"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Super Mass Gainer"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"SUPER-ANABOLIC MASS GAINER"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"ULTRA ANABOLIC GROWTH FACTORS, MUSCLE CELL PROTECTION, AND RECOVERY COMPONENTS FOR ENHANCED MUSCULARITY AND DENSITY^*"},{"type":"General Statements: All Other Content","notes":"Ultra Thermogenic"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"*In an 8-week study of healthy males performing resistance training, subjects taking this product's module of 20g whey protein and 6.2g leucine demonstrated an increased improvement in muscle strength and muscle size as compared to those performing the same training regimen on a placebo. In a second clinical study using a reduced volume resistance training protocol, the same anabolic module was shown to provide equal gains in maximum muscle strength and stamina when combined with one set or resistance training compared to two sets of the same amount of training without supplementation."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Beyond RAW(TM) Re-Built Mass is a monster mass gainer with clinically studied components shown to improve muscle size, stamina and strength.* This hardcore formula packs 850 mass building calories of the highest quality protein and ingredients to deliver lean mass and support a rock hard physique.* As a massive anabolic attack, it is loaded with 60 grams of fast, medium, and slow-acting protein for crucial nutrient timing of essential aminos fueling dense, bulging muscles and 130 grams of energy driving carbohydrates to support mammoth gains.* To feed your hunger for size, it has an intense 10 gram Advanced Creatine Complex with 5 forms of creatine, including micronized creatine and creatine precursors for the forceful, mind-blowing workouts you live for."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Beyond RAW(TM) Re-Built Mass is a physique building performance product, using a scientifically precise array of ingredients to fuel engorging muscles and the body's natural creatine production, enhance athletic performance and training, and promote recovery.* Re-Built Mass adds a rich concentration of an anabolic quad-phase stack including an extreme mixture of a triple source protein blend, critical carbohydrates, power-pushing creatine, plus clinically researched CLA shown to help maintain lean muscle mass.* Magnifying the effects are enzymes with proven bioactivity to help breakdown protein and maximize amino acid uptake and HMB to help improve muscle protein balance.* It's this distinct combination of fuel-enhancing, energy-initiating and supporting factors that sparks mass producing results and superior athletic performance.*"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"BioCore EDGE (TM) is a trademark of National Enzyme Company"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Clarinol(R) Clarinol(R) CLA is a registered trademark of Lipid Nutrition."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Fuel up fast with a rapid absorbing, clinically studied L-Alanyl-L-Glutamine diPeptide. Beyond RAW(TM) Re-Built Mass runs the spectrum of key anabolic factors to give you an explosive workout while guiding you to reach the ideal growth window you are striving to achieve."},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"Maximize your workout gains with the entire Beyond RAW(TM) line!"},{"type":"Brand IP Statement(s) re: (c), (TM), (SM)","notes":"SUSTAMINE(TM) Sustamine is a trademark of Kyowa Hakko Bio Co., Ltd."},{"type":"Formulation re: Does NOT Contain","notes":"CONTAINS: Milk and Soybeans."},{"type":"Precautions re: All Other","notes":"WARNING: Consult your physician prior to using this product if you are pregnant, nursing, taking medication, under 18 years of age or have a medical condition. Discontinue use two weeks prior to surgery."}],"targetGroups":["Adult (18 - 50 Years)"],"thumbnail":"","upcSku":"0 48107 09838 4","userGroups":[{"dailyValueTargetGroupName":"Adults and children 4 or more years of age","langualCode":"P0250","langualCodeDescription":"Adults and Children 4 years and above"}],"_source":"api"}